### Vendor convention

- Vendor name: `{{vendor_name}}` (lowercase) — module/component prefix, see `local/composer.json`
- PHP namespace vendor: `{{VENDOR_NAME}}` — e.g. `{{VENDOR_NAME}}\Main\Engine\BaseRepository`
- JS bundle namespace vendor: `{{VENDOR_NAME}}` — e.g. `{{VENDOR_NAME}}.<Module>.UI` (see `bundle.config.js`)
- Module prefix: `{{vendor_name}}.<modulename>`
- Custom components live in: `local/components/{{vendor_name}}/`
- JS extension IDs: `{{vendor_name}}.<module>...` (e.g. `{{vendor_name}}.<module>.ui.<feature>-editor`)
- DB table prefix: `{{db_prefix}}_` — used as `{{db_prefix}}_<table_name>` in `{{VENDOR_NAME}}\<Module>\Model\...Table` ORM entities

