### Tooling

- Test tooling: `{{TEST_TOOLING}}`

Style and check commands run from `/local/` (the composer root):

```bash
cd local

# 1. Syntax check for a single file
php -l <file>

# 2. Fix and Beautify
php vendor/bin/php-cs-fixer fix --config=.php-cs-fixer.dist.php  <path>
php vendor/bin/phpcbf --standard=.phpcs.xml --extensions=php <path>

# 3. Single-file style check
php vendor/bin/phpcs --standard=.phpcs.xml --extensions=php --report=json <path>
php vendor/bin/php-cs-fixer check --format=json --config=.php-cs-fixer.dist.php <path>
```

